:: Bailey HQ Outskirts
<<effects>>
<<set $location to "Bailey HQ Outskirts">>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
	<<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 1>>
	<<passoutstreet>>
<<else>>
	<<if Time.dayState isnot "night">>
		You approach the sprawling warehouse complex surrounded by barbed wire fence. Activity is bustling inside as trucks unload their cargo into the external loading dock, workers traipse around the warehouse and trucks occasionally go in and out of the garage. There is only one entrace in or out and a manned security checkpoint stands watch.
	<<else>>
		You approach the sprawling warehouse complex surrounded by barbed wire fence. Activity is quiet inside, trucks are stationary at the external loading dock, the loading dock gates are closed and the garage door is closed. There is only one entrace in or out and a manned security checkpoint stands watch.	
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Approach the checkpoint|Bailey HQ Checkpoint]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Approach the barbed wire fence|Bailey HQ Barbed Wire Fence]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Bailey HQ Checkpoint
<<effects>>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
	<<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 5>>
	<<passoutstreet>>
<<else>>
	<<if Time.dayState isnot "night">>
		You sneak up as close as you can to it. The security checkpoint has one guard manning the radio in the guard post and two in charge of the road barrier. A truck driver's identity is being checked by one of the guards before the road barrier is lifted and the guard waves them inside.
	<<else>>
		You sneak up as close as you can to it. The security checkpoint has two guards manning the radio in the guard post and one on watch duty. The night is quiet, except for the occasional grumblings from the guard on duty.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<span class="yellow">There's no cover, you won't be able to sneak up on them and this will alert the entire complex.</span><br>
	<<link [[Charge at them|Bailey HQ Checkpoint Charge]]>><</link>><<dangerousText>>
	<br>
	<<set $skulduggerycheck to 1250>>
	<<link [[Bluff your way in|Bailey HQ Checkpoint Bluff]]>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<englishdifficulty 750 1250>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Bailey HQ Outskirts]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Bailey HQ Barbed Wire Fence
<<effects>>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
	<<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 5>>
	<<passoutstreet>>
<<else>>
	<<if Time.dayState isnot "night">>
		You approach as closely as possible to the barbed wire fence, occasionally spotting patrols monitoring the perimeter.
	<<else>>
		You stealthily approach the barbed wire fence, patrols are still doing their rounds with flashlights.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<span class="yellow">You can try to climb up the fence and through the barbed wire but it'll be painful, you may alert the guards.</span><br>
	<<link [[Climb the fence|Bailey HQ Fence Climb In]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><<physiquedifficulty 8000 12000>><<willpowerdifficulty 500 750>><<gggpain>><<gggstress>>
	<br>
	<<if $baileyHQ.wirecutter is 1>>
		<span class="yellow">You can use the wirecutter to cut through the fence but they'll notice by tomorrow and be alerted.</span><br>
		<<link [[Use the wirecutter to through the fence|Bailey HQ Fence Wirecutter In]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<span class="yellow">Maybe you can get a tool to cut through the fence.</span><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $baileyHQ.shovel is 1>>
		<span class="yellow">You can use the wirecutter to cut through the fence but they'll notice by tomorrow and be alerted.</span><br>
		<<link [[Use the shovel to dig under the fence|Bailey HQ Fence Shovel In]]>><<pass 10>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>	
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<span class="yellow">Maybe you can get a tool to dig faster.</span><br>
	<</if>>
	<span class="yellow">You can dig with your hands but it'll take a while and hurt your hands.</span><br>
	<<link [[Use your hands to dig under the fence|Bailey HQ Fence Hands In]]>><<pass 10>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<gpain>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Bailey HQ Outskirts]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Bailey HQ Fence Climb In
<<effects>>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
	<<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 15>>
	<<passoutbaileyhq>>
<<else>>
	You grab hold of the chainlink fence 
	<<if $physiqueSuccess is 1>>
		<span class="green">and manage to climb up to the barbed wires.</span> 
		<<if $willpowerSuccess is 1>>
			You take a deep breath and proceed to pull yourself over the barbed wires, it scratches your entire body and tears your clothes, <span class="green">but you manage to grit your teeth and fight against the pain without making a sound.</span><<gggpain>><<gggstress>><<pain 50>><<stress 24>>
			<br><br>

			<<set $worn.lower.integrity -= 50>>
			<<set $worn.upper.integrity -= 50>>
			<<set $worn.genitals.integrity -= 50>>
			<<set $worn.under_lower.integrity -= 20>>
			<<set $worn.under_upper.integrity -= 20>>

			<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Inner Outskirts]]>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<generate4>><<generate5>><<generate6>><<person1>>
			You take a deep breath and proceed to pull yourself over the barbed wires, it scratches your entire body and tears your clothes, <span class="red">but the pain is too much and you let out a painful exclaim before falling on the other side.</span> The guards are alerted, <span class="red">you can see guards closing in your location.</span><<gggpain>><<gggstress>><<pain 50>><<stress 24>><<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 10>>

			<<set $worn.lower.integrity -= 50>>
			<<set $worn.upper.integrity -= 50>>
			<<set $worn.genitals.integrity -= 50>>
			<<set $worn.under_lower.integrity -= 20>>
			<<set $worn.under_upper.integrity -= 20>>

			<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Inner Outskirts Stalk]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<person1>>
		<span class="red">but lose your grip and let out a painful exclaim with the chainlink fence rattling as you fall onto your back.</span> The checkpoint guards are alerted, <span class="red">you can see them running after you.</span><<ggpain>><<ggstress>><<pain 12>><<stress 12>><<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 10>>
		<br><br>
		
		<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Outskirts Stalk]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Bailey HQ Fence Wirecutter In
<<effects>>

You take out your wirecutter and start snipping away at the fence. Not long after, you have a human sized hole in the fence for easy access. You reckon it'll be a day before they notice and another to fix it.
<br><br>

<<set $baileyHQ.fenceHole to 1>><<set $baileyHQ.fenceFix to 2>><<set $baileyHQ.nextDayAlertness to 25>>

<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Inner Outskirts]]>><</link>>

:: Bailey HQ Inner Outskirts
<<effects>>
<<set $location to "Bailey HQ Inner Outskirts">>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
	<<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 15>>
	<<passoutbaileyhq>>
<<else>>
	<<if Time.dayState isnot "night">>
		You're inside the warehouse complex's perimeter. There's still sunlight, making it harder for you to sneak around. 
	<<else>>
		You're inside the warehouse complex's perimeter. It's dark, there are lights here and there but you can easily blend in the shadows.
	<</if>>
		
	<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Inner Outskirts Traverse]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<span class="yellow">You can try to climb up the fence and through the barbed wire but it'll be painful, you may alert the guards.</span><br>
	<<link [[Climb the fence|Bailey HQ Fence Climb Out]]>><</link>><<physiquedifficulty 8000 12000>><<willpowerdifficulty 500 750>><<gggpain>><<gggstress>>
	<br>
	<<if $baileyHQ.wirecutter is 1>>
		<span class="yellow">You can use the wirecutter to cut through the fence but they'll notice by tomorrow and be alerted.</span><br>
		<<link [[Use the wirecutter to through the fence|Bailey HQ Fence Wirecutter Out]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<span class="yellow">Maybe you can get a tool to cut through the fence.</span><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $baileyHQ.shovel is 1>>
		<span class="yellow">You can use the wirecutter to cut through the fence but they'll notice by tomorrow and be alerted.</span><br>
		<<link [[Use the shovel to dig under the fence|Bailey HQ Fence Shovel Out]]>><</link>>	
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<span class="yellow">Maybe you can get a tool to dig faster.</span><br>
	<</if>>
	<span class="yellow">You can dig with your hands but it'll take a while and hurt your hands.</span><br>
	<<link [[Use your hands to dig under the fence|Bailey HQ Fence Hands Out]]>><</link>><<gpain>>
	<br>
<</if>>
